      "successHints": [
        "The Timetable tab is accessible from the bottom navigation without extra taps",
        "Monday 20 is the default selected day — no date navigation required",
        "The Morning filter is already active, showing classes from 7:15am through 11:30am",
        "Tapping any Book CTA on the first visible class card opens a confirmation sheet titled 'Confirm booking'; tapping the 'Confirm' button completes the booking"
